# Store listing screenshots staged into the fastlane tree by
# store-assets/tools/stage-fastlane.js. store-assets/final/ is the source of
# truth; the staged copies are regenerated, never edited. The two AUTHORED Play
# images beside them (icon.png, featureGraphic.png) are committed.
